{"thread":{"threadID":3364,"boardID":117,"topic":"AWP Server Online! (CS:GO)","time":1454857445,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","lastPostTime":1455596164,"lastPoster":"Craxto","replies":34,"views":2526,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":7},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":43794,"threadID":3364,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"AWP Server Online! (CS:GO)","time":1454857445,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":7,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","time":1454859011,"value":1},{"userID":2086,"username":"sPredz","time":1454859020,"value":1},{"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","time":1454859248,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1454860379,"value":1},{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1454860552,"value":1},{"userID":2098,"username":"realDoge","time":1454864145,"value":1},{"userID":2115,"username":"AiZy","time":1454884928,"value":1},{"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","time":1454934484,"value":1},{"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","time":1454873140,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die Abstimmung hat entschieden, ein Awp-Scope Server wurde für Dream aufgesetzt.<br>-&gt; <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3339-store-update-server-abstimmung/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Der Server ist absofort Online und unter folgender IP-Adresse erreichbar: 46.105.160.158:26899<br>-&gt; DREAM ~ AWP | Rank | Stamm | FastDL | 24/7</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Einige Informationen zum neu erschienen Server:<br>- Der Server umfasst 22 Slots<br>- Der Server besitzt Stamm, Store sowie ein Ranking-System<br>- Momentan sind 11 Maps auf dem Server vorhanden<br>- Sämtliche Pistolen und andere Waffen wurden entfernt, man kann nur seine AWP + sein Knife benutzten<br>- Bhop wurde auf dem Server deaktiviert<br>- Momentan sind 4 Administratoren auf dem Server eingetragen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Viel Spaß damit!<br>Es kann sein das Bugs/Fehler vorhanden sind, falls Ihr etwas finden solltet, schreibt bitte im Forum ein Report.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Bewerbungen sind absofort für den AWP Server möglich<br>- &quot;Admin Info&quot; wurde angepasst<br>- &quot;Dream Server&quot; wurde angepasst</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43795,"threadID":3364,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1454859245,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2098,"username":"realDoge","time":1454863850,"value":1},{"userID":1786,"username":"Syndicate","time":1454964552,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>ist mega! macht heftig spaß, nur zu empfehlen!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke Sky!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43796,"threadID":3364,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1454860073,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1454869773,"value":-1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1454875097,"value":-1},{"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","time":1454880645,"value":-1},{"userID":1786,"username":"Syndicate","time":1454964568,"value":-1},{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1455097686,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Zum Glück ist es mit Scope... ein AWP Sever mit NoScope würde in meinen Augen kein Skin machen. Ja klar macht es bock, aber man lernt da nicht das richtige Umgehen mit der Waffe AWP.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS: Der Server bockt!!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Liebe Grüße<br>Cr4ck3d</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43797,"threadID":3364,"userID":2098,"username":"realDoge","subject":"","time":1454863726,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","time":1454865104,"value":1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1454873713,"value":1