gefühlt 24/7 leer</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43985,"threadID":3364,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1455223476,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":335,"username":"Cornflakes","time":1455224689,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>In meinen Augen hat sich der Server in ein Ghosttown verwandelt, wie TF2 auf der PS3 oder Harlem Shake.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43991,"threadID":3364,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1455235095,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Oder wie &quot;Darf er das?&quot; R.I.P.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Better go noscope.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43993,"threadID":3364,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1455258437,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1455475524,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich glaube nicht, dass wenn man den Server auf No Scope umstellt mehr Leute kommen werden. Schließlich haben mehr als die Hälfte mit Scopen gewählt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43994,"threadID":3364,"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","subject":"","time":1455258821,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1455261806,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es stimmen zwar viele Spieler dafür ab doch selber spielen tun sie darauf nicht, was mich ein bisschen stört.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43995,"threadID":3364,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1455271164,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nunja, das liegt unter anderem daran, dass man alleine schlecht spielen kann...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43996,"threadID":3364,"userID":1933,"username":"Re(MiiX)","subject":"","time":1455271542,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dann müsst ihr den mal bisschen puschen . Also mit m8s drauf und gib ihm .</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43998,"threadID":3364,"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","subject":"","time":1455273958,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich werde den Server von nun an zum AWP Training mit mates nutzen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44073,"threadID":3364,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1455479316,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2111-baumi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Baumi</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ein Server der sozusagen &quot;nur&quot; für dich läuft. Warst du heute online so gegen anfangs Abend? Da waren nämlich genau 2 Leute und da dachte ich genau an dich <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Cr4ck3d</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44074,"threadID":3364,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1455479900,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>wir waren sogar 5 Leute gegen 18 Uhr.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44075,"threadID":3364,"userID":1670,"username":"Cr4ck3d","subject":"","time":1455479962,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Uuuuuuhh</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44076,"threadID":3364,"userID":1